---
layout: base.njk
permalink: /artifacts/index.html
title: Artifact Inventory
---

<header class="section-head">
  <h1>Artifact Inventory</h1>
  <p class="section-head__note">
    Four accessions. Two are held by the Archive, one is on loan, and one is
    unaccounted for. All four are catalogued.
  </p>
</header>

<ul class="inventory">
  {% for doc in collections.artifact %}
    <li class="accession">
      <a class="accession__link" href="{{ doc.url | url }}">
        <span class="accession__frame">
          <img src="{{ doc.data.image | url }}" alt="{{ doc.data.title }}"
               width="800" height="600" />
        </span>
        <span class="accession__title">{{ doc.data.title }}</span>
      </a>
      <span class="accession__meta">
        {{ doc.data.accession_number }} &middot; {{ doc.data.status }}
      </span>
    </li>
  {% endfor %}
</ul>

<p class="caption">
  Plates are measured drawings. Artifact photography is held offsite and has
  not been digitised.
</p>
